# atomic sandbox replay v1
# M2 "Select + drag, Delete key" and M4 "Play / Pause with Space": a click without motion on
# H2's nucleus 1 selects it (and sends nothing: a select-click never tethers it, review m2),
# Delete removes it, Space plays the H atom that is left, and Space again pauses it - a
# machine-dependent number of steps after the 2 waited for, so only the play state is checked.
view 1400 900
action smooth-motion false
# pinned at the merge of main (2026-10-14): written for the presets' own 49^3 x 0.25 grid (Balanced)
# without container walls, before the app defaulted to Accurate (81^3) with walls on; H2 is the
# R = 1.6 Bohr scene it was written for (h2_r16.scene; the h2 preset is 1.45 Bohr now)
action quality balanced
action walls off 4.5
scene h2_r16.scene
wait idle
action tool select
t 100 cursor -0.0981641 -0.0230282
t 110 button left down
t 160 button left up
expect selected 1
t 300 key delete down
t 380 key delete up
wait idle
expect nuclei 1
expect selected none
t 500 key space down
t 580 key space up
wait steps 2
expect paused false
t 900 key space down
t 980 key space up
wait idle
expect paused true
expect no-error
